he app gives your plan back. \"An urge, right now\": three minutes\nwith a breathing ring, your reason and your plan, then \"it passed\" or \"I slipped\". A plan\ndecided in advance, a start date that marks a fresh start, one line to tell someone where\nyou are. Widget with a ✓ that counts an urge beaten, optional daily reminder, backup.\nEach choice comes from the published research on habits and lapses. Text only, white on\nblack, six languages, no network permission.\n"}, "preferredSigner": "b9c722e093f963ab7812922623e1c1a72fb9998537ad7d9aefa8b1a3f3a8120c"}, "versions": {"bf50ea4efc760c9b843b5d3a0eecc6e3bd28692d417ab89a9b4f7fc386efa89c": {"added": 1792484734000, "file": {"name": "/ReadersMotivation-v1.0.0.apk", "sha256": "bf50ea4efc760c9b843b5d3a0eecc6e3bd28692d417ab89a9b4f7fc386efa89c", "size": 14647658}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a", "x86", "x86_64"], "versionName": "1.0.0", "versionCode": 1, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 28, "targetSdkVersion": 34}, "signer": {"sha256": ["b9c722e093f963ab7812922623e1c1a72fb9998537ad7d9aefa8b1a3f3a8120c"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED"}, {"name": "android.permission.VIBRATE"}, {"name": "com.freedomfighter.readersmotivation.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}}}, "com.freedomfighter.readersphone": {"metadata": {"lastUpdated": 1792439225000}, "versions": {"333e3c3ccb734d3ed7eaef357fca9ec6bf41492014f010f20a93efeceda07a0a": null, "eb6f4bb68a0b8166ad906af391d7715785edb13ef7966e7c8d37075c59c43f16": {"added": 1792439225000, "file": {"name": "/ReadersPhone-v1.3.1.apk", "sha256": "eb6f4bb68a0b8166ad906af391d7715785edb13ef7966e7c8d37075c59c43f16", "size": 36202173}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "x86_64"], "versionName": "1.3.1", "versionCode": 6, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 34}, "signer": {"sha256": ["b9c722e093f963ab7812922623e1c1a72fb9998537ad7d9aefa8b1a3f3a8120c"]}, "usesP